<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Idemnity Corp on Wednesday said that it qualifed for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Jefferson County, Ky., $18.5 million Project bonds, direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Greenville County, S.C., School District, $31.5 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
